<title>USA: Tempe, Ariz., won by Robert Baird. [CORRECTED 22:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Tempe, Ariz., won by Robert Baird. [CORRECTED 22:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Baird (corrects from William R. Hough) said it won $14.500 million of Tempe, Ariz., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.380 percent.  </p>
<p>AMT: 14,500,000     DATE: 05/01/97	NYC Time: 1200	CUSIP: 879709</p>
<p>ISSUER: Tempe							     ST: AZ</p>
