<p>DTD: 05/01/97							     SURE BID: Y</p>
<p>DUE: 7/1/98-17						SR MGR: Robert Baird</p>
<p>1ST CPN: 01/01/98					   DOLLAR BID: 100.028</p>
<p>CALL: 7/1/06 @ 101, dtp 7/1/07			  NIC 5.377</p>
